.DS_Store
xcuserdata/
*.xcodeproj
/.build
/DerivedData
.swiftpm/

# Raw device-test artifacts (drive logs, sqlite dumps, personal photos) stay local
Docs/tests/

# **Real trip dumps never enter the repo** (privacy principle, CLAUDE.md §0).
# `Tools/exif-to-fixture.sh` writes here, and the render harnesses prefer it over
# the committed synthetic fixture of the same name. A whole-directory rule on
# purpose: a filename pattern is one `mytrip.json` away from being defeated, and
# what leaks is a person's movements, not a build artifact.
Tests/Fixtures/trips/local/

# Local deployment secrets/overrides (Deploy/.env.example is the checked-in template)
Deploy/.env

# Built routing + tile artifacts are gigabytes and live outside the repo
# ($KAMOME_DATA_DIR, default ~/kamome-osrm) — this only catches strays.
*.osm.pbf
*.pmtiles
!Tests/Fixtures/tiles/*.pmtiles
